From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:24:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] ASoC: codecs: wcd939x: Set the bandgap fine adjust of
 v1.1 and later

Qualcomm's vendor driver for the WCD939x writes 0xa5 to the bandgap
fine adjust register (BIAS_VBG_FINE_ADJ, 0x3029; reset value 0x55) on
codec versions 1.1 and 2.0, in the register patch it applies after it
has read the version (reg_def_1_1 in the vendor wcd939x.c).

Write the vendor value from wcd939x_io_init() when the version read in
the component probe is v1.1 or later; v1.0, or a version that could
not be read, keeps the reset value, as in the vendor driver.

Pointed out by Reixo (Reixo0/nx809j-mainline), whose port sets the
same value; the version condition and the value are taken from the
vendor driver of the OnePlus SM8850 kernel.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
index a52ae36ce250..974ca92aabca 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
@@ -46,6 +46,9 @@
 /* Version minor: x.1 */
 #define CHIPID_WCD939X_VER_MINOR_1	0x3
 
+/* Bandgap fine adjust of Qualcomm's driver for v1.1 and later (reset value 0x55) */
+#define WCD939X_VBG_FINE_ADJ_V1_1	0xa5
+
 enum {
 	WCD939X_VERSION_1_0 = 0,
 	WCD939X_VERSION_1_1,
@@ -363,6 +366,8 @@ static int wcd939x_set_swr_clk_rate(struct snd_soc_component *component, int rat
 
 static int wcd939x_io_init(struct snd_soc_component *component)
 {
+	struct wcd939x_priv *wcd939x = snd_soc_component_get_drvdata(component);
+
 	snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD939X_ANA_BIAS,
 				      WCD939X_BIAS_ANALOG_BIAS_EN, true);
 	snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD939X_ANA_BIAS,
@@ -373,6 +378,10 @@ static int wcd939x_io_init(struct snd_soc_component *component)
 	snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD939X_ANA_BIAS,
 				      WCD939X_BIAS_PRECHRG_EN, false);
 
+	if (wcd939x->version_known && wcd939x->version >= WCD939X_VERSION_1_1)
+		snd_soc_component_write(component, WCD939X_BIAS_VBG_FINE_ADJ,
+					WCD939X_VBG_FINE_ADJ_V1_1);
+
 	snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD939X_HPH_NEW_INT_RDAC_HD2_CTL_L,
 				      WCD939X_RDAC_HD2_CTL_L_HD2_RES_DIV_CTL_L, 0x15);
 	snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD939X_HPH_NEW_INT_RDAC_HD2_CTL_R,
